<Transform translation='41.675 3 -7.444' scale='0.19 0.19 0.19'><TouchSensor DEF='T_heuristic_H_TRC_11' description="H-TRC-11 [C] Give a model the offsets and node handles of a check, not the quotes: the answer must not carry the document'… Evidence cites no id."/><Shape><Appearance USE='A_heu_C_free'/><IndexedFaceSet USE='G_tet'/></Shape></Transform>
<Transform translation='41.79 3 -6.602' scale='0.19 0.19 0.19'><TouchSensor DEF='T_heuristic_H_TRC_12' description="H-TRC-12 [C] Have the verifier reviewed by someone who has not seen its code, and keep the open failures as expected-failu… Evidence cites no id."/><Shape><Appearance USE='A_heu_C_free'/><IndexedFaceSet USE='G_tet'/></Shape></Transform>
<Transform translation='41.906 3 -5.76' scale='0.19 0.19 0.19'><TouchSensor DEF='T_heuristic_H_TRC_13' description="H-TRC-13 [L] Where the exporter knows where a number came from, record the datablock and the conversion and recompute; use… Evidence cites no id."/><Shape><Appearance USE='A_heu_L_free'/><IndexedFaceSet USE='G_tet'/></Shape></Transform>
<Transform translation='42.022 3 -4.918' scale='0.19 0.19 0.19'><TouchSensor DEF='T_heuristic_H_TRC_14' description="H-TRC-14 [C] Measure a verifier's false-verify rate with planted claims of known truth and quote an upper bound, not only… Evidence cites no id."/><Shape><Appearance USE='A_heu_C_free'/><IndexedFaceSet USE='G_tet'/></Shape></Transform>
<Transform translation='39.891 5.5 -7.199'><TouchSensor DEF='T_drill_D_TRC_1' description="D-TRC-1 The grade a verdict allows (L1), ran."/><Shape><Appearance USE='A_drill_ran'/><Box USE='G_cube'/></Shape></Transform>
